# Always enumerate intended targets explicitly and verify each (preference)

Standing user preference: Always enumerate intended targets explicitly and verify each one was actually processed — a clean exit code alone is not sufficient confirmation.

## Conventions
- Always enumerate intended targets explicitly and verify each one was actually processed — a clean exit code alone is not sufficient confirmation.

